              <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-semibold bg-[#eff6ff]/40 text-[#059669]">
                ✓ 100% Free Draft Export & Print
              </td>
              <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#64748b]">✗ Hides subscription fee until final step</td>
            </tr>

            <tr class="hover:bg-[#f8fafc] transition-colors">
              <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-bold text-[#0f172a]">State Stamp Duty & Deposit Calc</td>
